# The image takes only what the Dockerfile COPYs (package.json,
# backend/package.json, backend/src, src/engine). This file keeps secrets,
# dependencies, build output, local tool state and logs out of the build
# context. Plain exclusions only - never a "!" re-include - and no rule may
# reach inside a copied path: Render's context filter dropped src/engine
# while rules excluded files inside it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/node_modules
dist
.claude
.vercel
.fly
.railway
**/*.log
